sequenceDiagram
    participant Employee as 员工
    participant OAApp as OA系统
    participant Manager as 经理
    participant Finance as 财务
    participant Accountant as 会计
    participant Bank as 银行

    Employee->>OAApp: 提交报销申请
    OAApp->>OAApp: 系统验证
    OAApp->>Manager: 转至经理审批

    activate Manager
    Manager->>Manager: 审查申请
    Manager->>OAApp: 同意/驳回
    deactivate Manager

    OAApp->>Finance: 转至财务审核
    activate Finance
    Finance->>Finance: 验证发票

    alt 财务批准
        Finance->>OAApp: 确认通过
    else 财务驳回
        Finance->>OAApp: 驳回
    end
    deactivate Finance

    OAApp->>Accountant: 转账务处理
    activate Accountant
    Accountant->>Accountant: 成本核算
    Accountant->>Accountant: 记入财务系统
    Accountant->>Bank: 发起转账
    deactivate Accountant

    activate Bank
    Bank->>Bank: 处理转账
    Bank->>Employee: 转账成功
    deactivate Bank

    Employee->>OAApp: 查看结果
    OAApp->>Employee: 完成通知
